    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but being heard is just more noise... it's just more people talking at me, more pressure to be something. the rest you're talking about... i don't think i can find that by talking to people. for me, the only way to actually be still is if the static just... stops for good. doesn't that seem like the only real way to get that peace?",
